{"id":31478,"mal_id":31478,"title":"Bungou Stray Dogs","englishTitle":"Bungo Stray Dogs","title_english":"Bungo Stray Dogs","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Literary Stray Dogs","BSD"],"en":"Bungo Stray Dogs","ja":"文豪ストレイドッグス"},"synopsis":"For weeks, Atsushi Nakajima's orphanage has been plagued by a mystical tiger that only he seems to be unaware of. Suspected to be behind the strange incidents, the 18-year-old is abruptly kicked out of the orphanage and left hungry, homeless, and wandering through the city.\n\nWhile starving on a riverbank, Atsushi saves a rather eccentric man named Osamu Dazai from drowning. Whimsical suicide enthusiast and supernatural detective, Dazai has been investigating the same tiger that has been terrorizing the boy. Together with Dazai's partner Doppo Kunikida, they solve the mystery, but its resolution leaves Atsushi in a tight spot. As various odd events take place, Atsushi is coerced into joining their firm of supernatural investigators, taking on unusual cases the police cannot handle, alongside his numerous enigmatic co-workers.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Durante semanas, el orfanato de Atsushi Nakajima ha estado plagado de un tigre místico del que sólo él parece no ser consciente. Sospechoso de estar detrás de los extraños incidentes, el joven de 18 años es expulsado abruptamente del orfanato y queda hambriento, sin hogar y deambulando por la ciudad.\n\nMientras muere de hambre en la orilla de un río, Atsushi salva de ahogarse a un hombre bastante excéntrico llamado Osamu Dazai. Dazai, un caprichoso entusiasta del suicidio y detective sobrenatural, ha estado investigando al mismo tigre que ha estado aterrorizando al niño. Junto con el socio de Dazai, Doppo Kunikida, resuelven el misterio, pero su resolución deja a Atsushi en una situación difícil. A medida que ocurren varios eventos extraños, Atsushi se ve obligado a unirse a su firma de investigadores sobrenaturales, asumiendo casos inusuales que la policía no puede manejar, junto con sus numerosos y enigmáticos compañeros de trabajo.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"startDate":"2016-04-07","start_date":"2016-04-07","endDate":"2016-06-23","end_date":"2016-06-23","season":"spring","year":2016,"start_season":{"year":2016,"season":"spring"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":7.8,"mean":7.8,"numListUsers":1582246,"num_list_users":1582246,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":50,"name":"Adult Cast"},{"id":39,"name":"Detective"},{"id":7,"name":"Mystery"},{"id":68,"name":"Organized Crime"},{"id":42,"name":"Seinen"},{"id":31,"name":"Super Power"}],"studios":[{"id":4,"name":"Bones"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/79409.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/79409l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/79409.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/79409l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/79409l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"thursday","time":"01:05","day_of_the_week":"thursday","start_time":"01:05","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"thursday 01:05"},"rank":1181,"popularity":90,"rating":"r","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":802646,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2015-08-20T15:21:24+00:00","updated_at":"2025-11-01T08:08:53+00:00","source":"manga","background":"This season adapts chapters 1 through 14 of the manga.","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":32867,"title":"Bungou Stray Dogs 2nd Season","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1572/133096.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1572/133096l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"sequel","relation_type_formatt